From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PickleHik3 <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Look for libfeedback in ../lib of the binary

feedbackd builds libfeedback as a shared library whatever default_library says. The archive
has bin/phosh and lib/libfeedback-0.0.so, so the binary looks one directory up.

diff --git a/src/meson.build b/src/meson.build
index c42c21d..b057c81 100644
--- a/src/meson.build
+++ b/src/meson.build
@@ -680,6 +680,9 @@ phosh = executable(
   dependencies: phosh_static_lib_dep,
   link_depends: dynamic_list,
   link_args: phosh_export_sym_link_arg,
+  # libfeedback (a shared library, as feedbackd builds it) is shipped in lib/ next to the
+  # directory the binary is installed into
+  install_rpath: '$ORIGIN/../lib',
   install: true,
   install_dir: libexecdir,
 )
